Trademarks and protocol
-----------------------

The Devin / Windsurf / Codeium / Cognition protocol implemented by this
gateway is proprietary and undocumented. This project is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or supported by any of those companies. It accesses the upstream
service with a session token supplied by the operator; use it only in
accordance with the upstream terms of service.

The "Devin" name is used descriptively only.
